*> vybe-test: cobol/string_delimited_forms/string_result_then_displayed
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_string_delimited_forms.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 FIRST PIC X(5) VALUE "JOHN ".
01 LAST PIC X(5) VALUE "DOE  ".
01 FULL PIC X(12) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    STRING FIRST DELIMITED BY SPACE " " DELIMITED BY SIZE LAST DELIMITED BY SPACE INTO FULL.
    DISPLAY FULL.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING FULL DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "JOHN DOE    "
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [JOHN DOE    ] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

